                "line_start": 441,
                "line_end": 467,
                "premise_scope": "A witnessed circumstantial predicate modifies an independently licensed owner and event/scope. Indefiniteness may be semantic rather than orthographic; owners normally have definiteness or a stated exception. Derived/transient descriptions are frequent, not universal requirements. Clausal hal needs its own pronoun/waw link. No unconditional identity or enduring unqualified property follows."
              }
            }
          ],
